This product includes data from the following source.

Nasdaq TotalView-ITCH 5.0
  Complete order-by-order message files for seven US equity trading days,
  retrieved from https://emi.nasdaq.com/ITCH/Nasdaq%20ITCH/ where Nasdaq
  publishes them for public use.  Each file carries every add, execute, cancel,
  delete and replace message for every Nasdaq-listed security on that day, with
  nanosecond timestamps.

  Days used: 2019-01-30, 2019-03-27, 2019-07-30, 2019-08-30, 2019-10-30,
  2019-12-30 and 2020-01-30.

  No raw or trade-level data is redistributed in this repository.  What is
  committed is the *derived* measurements in results/ -- fitted exponents,
  intensity tables, histograms and summary statistics -- together with the code
  in scripts/ that regenerates them from the source.  The extraction streams
  each file from the socket and never writes it to disk.

  The format is documented in Nasdaq's TotalView-ITCH 5.0 specification.  The
  field offsets used here are transcribed in src/hfx/itch/spec.py and checked
  against an independently written encoder in src/hfx/itch/synth.py, so a
  mistake in the transcription fails the test suite rather than the analysis.
